[Music]  sean mendes is opening up to fans about  his mental health after announcing he's  postponing his north american wonder  world tour dates for three weeks sharing  his decision on instagram he writes i've  been touring since i was 15 and to be  honest it's always been difficult to be  on the road away from friends and family  after a few years off the road i felt  like i was ready to dive back in but  that decision was premature and  unfortunately the toll of the road and  the pressure has caught up to me and  i've hit a breaking point sean added  that after speaking with health  professionals and his team he needs time  to quote heal take care of myself and my  mental health  john previously opened up to us about  the feelings of loneliness he sometimes  faces while on tour there's always this  like two and a half week point when  you're like why am i so like lonely and  depressed after two and a half weeks i  gotta get back home and see my family  you're not you're just like in that mode  like oh yeah we're out here for a minute  but he did ensure us that touring is one  of his favorite parts of the job if i  had to choose one thing in my career to  do or it's touring i always like to  think about touring as like  you can make a show this big ball of  happiness right and then you just like  travel the world and if you're lucky  maybe that concert can be five of the 15  000 people in the arena's best night  sure so if you're traveling around the  world and you're making all of these  people's best night of the year it's  this incredibly positive thing and shawn  recently announced his new social impact  initiative attached to his 87 date  wonder world tour in partnership with  disney plus the sean mendes foundation  plans to give wunder grants to youth  changemakers working in the areas of  children's health and wellness in every  tour market sean will also visit  children's hospitals in the us to grant  wishes to patients  [Music]  john's announcement comes after justin  bieber had to postpone the remainder of  his north american tour as he deals with  his recent ramsey hunt syndrome  diagnosis which causes facial paralysis

